{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lily Fantasia</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the brand-new rhythm game Lily Fantasia! Pick up your magical piano and fight for your destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/560852e18cf884f927afe0c06230ed8b.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/560852e18cf884f927afe0c06230ed8b.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/560852e18cf884f927afe0c06230ed8b.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white notes dance across the lively score. Amid the chaos on screen, listen closely to the rhythm, seize the beat, and strive for a perfect performance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fantastical musical adventure in Story Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you are a talented but overlooked concert pianist, Hiano Kenji. To take care for your seriously ill mother, you gave up your dream of becoming a concert pianist\u2026 But after meeting the mysterious vampire Lily, you are forced to embark on a journey to obtain the mythical panacea, the Golden Apple, and save your mother standing at death\u2019s door by playing the magical piano!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey to obtain the Golden Apple, various enemies will appear and attack you. Don\u2019t panic! Through the magical piano, you can hear the heartbeat of enemies before they strike. Listen carefully to their rhythm and press the Deflect key in the same rhythm to block the attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond its touching story and unique gameplay, the game features seven original story songs composed by renowned artists including PYKAMIA, Cansol, XinG, Sakuzyo, DDD-Dice, 3R2, and 10lulu. You won\u2019t be disappointed\u2014face a wide variety of foes and fulfill your vow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freely enjoy Lily\u2019s Practice Room!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play at your own pace? Head to \u201cLily\u2019s Practice Room,\u201d a Free Play mode packed with 20 handpicked songs from across the globe. From intense electronic music to emotional Artcore, a wide range of genres awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried you\u2019re new to rhythm games and can\u2019t handle high difficulty? No worries! Every song offers at least three difficulty levels, suitable for both beginners and seasoned experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/c6d2cc13969e3704c92561099b4bba7f.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/c6d2cc13969e3704c92561099b4bba7f.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/c6d2cc13969e3704c92561099b4bba7f.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your piano skills are top-tier? Compete against players worldwide on the global leaderboards! Each song also has its own friends leaderboard so you can challenge your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, Lily also keeps your local records, so you can track your improvement over time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1aa6ffd3a5955b33a52c781838a5e5d1.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1aa6ffd3a5955b33a52c781838a5e5d1.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1aa6ffd3a5955b33a52c781838a5e5d1.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u009e\u00a0\u00a0 20 handpicked songs for Free Play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u009e\u00a0\u00a0 7 original story songs by renowned composers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u009e\u00a0\u00a0 Online leaderboards (Global / Friends / Local)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u009e\u00a0\u00a0 Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u009e\u00a0\u00a0 Fully customizable key bindings to suit your preferred setup</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527300?t=1770998476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/2669594597084d16bbebc429c7381dd0b7496009/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770998476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse