bark on a journey to obtain the mythical panacea, the Golden Apple, and save your mother standing at death\u2019s door by playing the magical piano!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/e4224362940c3032262fe51c48e7211b.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the journey to obtain the Golden Apple, various enemies will appear and attack you. Don\u2019t panic! Through the magical piano, you can hear the heartbeat of enemies before they strike. Listen carefully to their rhythm and press the Deflect key in the same rhythm to block the attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/1b614bec3287a566978caabac49dd915.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond its touching story and unique gameplay, the game features seven original story songs composed by renowned artists including PYKAMIA, Cansol, XinG, Sakuzyo, DDD-Dice, 3R2, and 10lulu. You won\u2019t be disappointed\u2014face a wide variety of foes and fulfill your vow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9ae3125e484fab4cb47003a7bc5f8aa1.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freely enjoy Lily\u2019s Practice Room!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play at your own pace? Head to \u201cLily\u2019s Practice Room,\u201d a Free Play mode packed with 20 handpicked songs from across the globe. From intense electronic music to emotional Artcore, a wide range of genres awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.poster.avif?t=1770998476\" width=768 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.webm?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527300/extras/9df56af4cb39e2c24d6d92b9d4962987.mp4?t=1770998476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worried you\u2019re new to rhythm games and can\u2019t handle high difficulty? No worries! Every song offers at least three difficulty levels, suitable for both beginners and seasoned experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i